  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude in the shipped content carries tuningStatus untuned and the balance harness owns all of them -- so this file is a measurement and not a balance claim.",
    "The universe is still degenerate in the following ways, and this edit closes none of them. Nothing in packages/scenario opens a portal, so no raid runs in any committed sweep and no summon is ever created. Scribing still stops when the materials stock empties.",
    "This is one of two committed gates that play a god verb at all. balance:gate and balance:gate:horizon run passive-control fixed, whose preference list is empty, so their 400 runs submit no intervention. balance-gate-agency-v1 now covers that blind spot at twenty years for about nine seconds; this gate remains the only one that can observe the win condition."
